#: includes/compat/Akismet.php:35
msgid "Akismet"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Akismet.php:39
msgid "Comment spam screening"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Akismet.php:47
msgid "Akismet is active and screens comment spam on its own hook behind this plugin's gate — this plugin's comment gate runs first, ahead of every comment plugin. Layered cooperation (skipping the built-in rules for submissions Akismet has already caught) is planned, not yet built; this row never touches Akismet's config."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Akismet.php:51
msgid "No interaction. If Akismet is added later, this row turns into the coexistence note automatically — detection runs live on each settings page render, nothing is stored."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/FluentComments.php:56
msgid "FluentComments"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/FluentComments.php:60
msgid "AJAX comment form"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/FluentComments.php:68
msgid "FluentComments replaces the native comment form with its own AJAX form and, while inserting a submission, strips third-party callbacks off the comment preprocessing hooks (Akismet is on its allow list). When FluentComments is detected, this plugin re-registers its comment gate onto that allow list — the gate still screens AJAX submissions, and its layered spam guard composes behind it. How the challenge renders inside its AJAX flow is a live-machine follow-up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/FluentComments.php:72
msgid "No interaction. If FluentComments is added later, this row turns into the AJAX-form coexistence note automatically — detection runs live, nothing is stored."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Wordfence.php:36
msgid "Wordfence"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Wordfence.php:40
msgid "Login captcha overlap"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Wordfence.php:48
msgid "Wordfence is active. With both plugins verifying logins, visitors may face two captchas in a row — who guards the login captcha (keep one, or let one yield) is a decision for a later batch. Informational only; neither plugin's config is touched."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/Wordfence.php:52
msgid "No interaction. If Wordfence is added later, this row turns into the login-captcha overlap note automatically — detection runs live, nothing is stored."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/WpArmour.php:42
msgid "WP Armour"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/WpArmour.php:46
msgid "Honeypot anti-spam"
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/WpArmour.php:54
msgid "WP Armour's honeypot guards comment submissions: bots that fill its hidden field are caught with no challenge shown, humans pass it without noticing. Its check rides the same preprocessing hook this plugin's gate uses, behind it — the two compose harmlessly. No config is touched either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/compat/WpArmour.php:58
msgid "No interaction. If WP Armour is added later, this row turns into the honeypot composition note automatically — detection runs live, nothing is stored."
msgstr ""

